Package: ooshred
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Description: CRYPTO SHREDDER
 Overwrites file locations with pseudorandom passes before unlinking from inodes.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 oote theme palettes, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
